        'details' => '<h2>Planning a mini-split</h2><p>Each indoor unit should be sized to its room, not just to the whole home. Placement matters too: indoor units need a clear path for air, and the outdoor unit needs clearance, a stable pad or wall bracket, and in snowy climates, elevation above typical snow depth.</p><h2>Keeping it clean</h2><p>Rinse or vacuum the washable filters in each indoor unit every few weeks during heavy use. A professional cleaning of the coil and blower wheel every year or two keeps airflow strong and odors away.</p>',
