        'details' => '<h2>Choosing a duct cleaning provider</h2><p>Be cautious with very low advertised prices, which are sometimes used to upsell unnecessary services. Ask what equipment is used, whether the blower and coil are included, and whether before-and-after photos are provided. Industry standards from NADCA (the National Air Duct Cleaners Association) are a useful reference.</p>',
